    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That approach makes sense. It is much safer than a sudden move. But I worry about the digital footprint. In this age of constant surveillance, how can a person of my standing ensure that any subtle connections or legacies of my house are not uncovered by the intelligence agencies currently protecting the usurpers? Is there a way to build these networks using modern tools without revealing the true nature of my identity?",
